[A NightElf][G 70.31,40.81 Stormwind City]Talk to *Wilder Thistlenettle* \\ Accept [QA167 Oh Brother. . .] \\ Accept [QA168 Collecting Memories]
[A NightElf][O][L 68.6,28.19 Stormwind City]Go to the *Stormwind Library* and talk to *Lady Dena Kennedy* \\ She walks around slightly in the Royal Gallery \\ Turn in [QT95189 Crest of Lordaeron]
[A NightElf][O][L 56.32,53.98 Stormwind City]Talk to *Orphan Matron Nightingale* \\ Turn in [QT92415 Remember That I Love You] \\ Accept [QA95161 Remember That I Love You]
